@startuml
' bt-view-kind: context
' bt-view-id: architecture-assurance:system-context
title Architecture Assurance - Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: architect
' bt-element-id: assurance
' bt-element-id: repo
' bt-element-id: akdb

actor "Architect / Maintainer\nResponsibility: State decisions, classify drift and approve target architecture\nContract: Reviewed SAD and model-catalog changes\n[[../../../../docs/architecture/project/architecture-assurance/architecture.md source]]" as architect
rectangle "Architecture Assurance\nResponsibility: Discover, correlate, validate and export architecture evidence\nContract: Deterministic CLI and report schemas\n[[../../../../tools/architecture_assurance/cli.py source]]" as assurance
rectangle "Better Tomorrow Repository\nResponsibility: Provide current code, documents and Git history\nContract: Read-only discovery except generated architecture artifacts\n[[../../../../.git source]]" as repo
rectangle "External AKDB\nResponsibility: Validate and export canonical architecture knowledge\nContract: Pinned disposable checkout\n[[../../../../tests/architecture_assurance/test_disposable_akdb_integration.py source]]" as akdb

architect ..> assurance : "authors intent and runs audit\ncontract: reviewed invocation\n[[../../../../tools/architecture_assurance/cli.py source]]"
assurance ..> akdb : "validates disposable export\ncontract: pinned external checkout\n[[../../../../tests/architecture_assurance/test_disposable_akdb_integration.py source]]"
assurance ..> repo : "discovers and correlates\ncontract: source and Git evidence\n[[../../../../tools/architecture_assurance/discovery.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: context
Concern: Human intent, repository truth and disposable external AKDB
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
